Read `.github/instructions/engine-native.instructions.md`. Engine/dynamics owns
ingest-side kernels; engine/synthesis owns output/model construction/export;
engine/core owns common primitives. C#/SQL orchestrate. No GPU dependency is part of
the architecture. After any engine rebuild, rebuild and install extensions, then verify
the installed API/health surface.
